1230
01:36:59,631 --> 01:37:00,674
Papai?

1231
01:37:00,966 --> 01:37:02,008
Pai?

1232
01:37:02,926 --> 01:37:03,969
Papai?

1233
01:37:04,260 --> 01:37:05,512
Acorde!

1234
